WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:02.400
I just vibe-coded an entire app in two hours.

00:02.400 --> 00:05.600
It works. It looks great, but I have no idea if it's actually secure.

00:05.600 --> 00:07.600
Like, could someone hack this thing?

00:07.600 --> 00:10.800
Oh, they absolutely could. And they will.

00:10.800 --> 00:14.800
Unless you use these five prompts to lock it down before it's too late.

00:14.800 --> 00:16.000
Prom number one.

00:16.000 --> 00:19.600
Tell your AI to implement rate limiting on all endpoints.

00:19.600 --> 00:22.800
Five attempts max per 15 minutes on login routes.

00:22.800 --> 00:25.600
That way hackers can't brute force their way in.

00:25.600 --> 00:27.040
Oh yeah, that's smart.

00:27.040 --> 00:29.440
What about the passwords I left in the code?

00:29.440 --> 00:30.640
You did what?

00:30.640 --> 00:32.800
That's prompt number two, you buffoon.

00:32.800 --> 00:36.240
Tell the AI to scan your entire code base for any hard code.

00:38.640 --> 00:40.080
And prompt three.

00:40.080 --> 00:43.440
Move all sensitive data to environment variables.

00:43.440 --> 00:46.800
Make sure nothing is exposed in the front end or committed to get.

00:46.800 --> 00:48.640
You absolute walnut.

00:48.640 --> 00:50.640
Okay, okay, I'm writing this down.

00:50.640 --> 00:51.600
What else?

00:51.600 --> 00:52.640
Promt four.

00:52.640 --> 00:56.400
Scented eyes all user inputs and reject anything oversized or malformed.

00:56.400 --> 00:59.280
Unless you want someone injecting code straight into your database.

00:59.600 --> 01:01.200
That sounds bad.

01:01.200 --> 01:02.560
It is bad, Peter.

01:02.560 --> 01:04.800
And finally, prompt five.

01:04.800 --> 01:08.640
Run a full security audit and report any remaining vulnerabilities.

01:08.640 --> 01:12.400
Think of it as a final health check before you unleash your little creation on the world.

01:12.960 --> 01:17.120
Bang, Struy, you just saved my app and probably my identity.

01:17.120 --> 01:18.080
You're welcome.

01:18.080 --> 01:21.120
Now, if you found this useful, follow this page for more tips.

01:21.120 --> 01:23.040
So you don't get destroyed on the internet.

01:23.040 --> 01:23.680
Do it now.

